  "message/data/event/mes/info/lvup/lvup22-02.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]盐浪\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/lvup/lvup22-03.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]阿修罗掌\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/lvup/lvup22-04.txt/0": "获得了新技能！\r\n但是……",
