  "message/data/event/mes/info/lvup/lvup23-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]贵族律法\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/lvup/lvup23-02.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]神圣律法\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess01-01.txt/0": "不过是转瞬之间的战斗。\r\n现在，去吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess02-01.txt/0": "你一路走到这里，辛苦了，\r\n勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。\r\n请允许我赐予你力量。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess02-02.txt/0": "但我只能赐予你一种力量，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。\r\n你希望得到什么力量？",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess03-01.txt/0": "很好。你可以选择一种：\r\n\\c[52]剑\\c[0]、\\c[52]斧\\c[0]、\\c[52]弓\\c[0]、\r\n\\c[52]枪\\c[0]或\\c[52]法杖\\c[0]？",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess04-01.txt/0": "明白了。\r\n嗯，很遗憾，即使你继续成长，\r\n也无法获得这个技能。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess04-02.txt/0": "知道了。\r\n哦……看来你已经学会这个技能的一部分。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess04-03.txt/0": "非常抱歉，但对已经学会\r\n哪怕1个技能的人来说，\r\n这份力量不会生效。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess05-01.txt/0": "如你所愿，就此定下。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]雷霆魔力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-02.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]束缚魔力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-03.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]治疗魔力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-04.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]炼狱魔力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-05.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]守护魔力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-06.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]神圣火焰\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-07.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]神圣光弹\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-08.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了技能\r\n\\c[52]召唤魔力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess06-09.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]遗忘了技能\\c[52]学习魔力\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess07-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\r\n\\c[52]爱之刃\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess07-02.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\r\n\\c[52]不屈之斧\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess07-03.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\r\n\\c[52]希望之弓\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess07-04.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\r\n\\c[52]忠诚之枪\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess07-05.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\r\n\\c[52]辉煌法杖\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess07-06.txt/0": "这些礼物由我的力量凝聚而成。\r\n但它们只在这个世界中有效。\r\n无法离开这个世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess08-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\\c[52]护甲书札\\c[0]、\r\n\\c[52]盾牌书札\\c[0]、\\c[52]甜坚果\\c[0]、\r\n\\c[52]幻影片\\c[0]、\\c[52]常春藤触手\\c[0]、\r\n\\c[52]天马之雾\\c[0]、\\c[52]心灵叶\\c[0]\r\n和\\c[52]传送药剂\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess08-02.txt/0": "这些礼物由我的力量凝聚而成。\r\n但它们只在这个世界中有效。\r\n无法离开这个世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/info/nw_goddess/nw_goddess09-01.txt/0": "现在，去吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-01.txt/0": "你终于来了……我们的孩子，勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n如你所知，世界正面临\r\n前所未有的危机。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-02.txt/0": "一切仅始于几天前。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-03.txt/0": "\\c[52]灾厄的使者\\c[0]出现在西方。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-04.txt/0": "她是堕天使\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]，\r\n向我们的世界释放了名为\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]的灾难。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-05.txt/0": "这场\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]会将所有生物\r\n化为白灰，并不断向东推进……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-06.txt/0": "即使现在，它也正迅速逼近我们的城堡。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-07.txt/0": "万物正在逐渐被吞噬，\r\n我们或许正目睹世界的终结。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-08.txt/0": "勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，\r\n我们不能再拖延了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-09.txt/0": "我们已年老，因此派你代替我们向东，\r\n去讨伐堕天使\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-10.txt/0": "我们祈祷你不会败给那始终威胁着我们的\r\n西方之光。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-11.txt/0": "因为被光吞没的人，永远无法回来。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c01/ms002c01-12.txt/0": "哦，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，一切都托付给你了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c02/ms002c02-01.txt/0": "你终于来了……我们的孩子，勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n如你所知，世界正面临\r\n前所未有的危机。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c02/ms002c02-02.txt/0": "一切仅始于几天前。\r\n\\c[52]灾厄的使者\\c[0]毫无预兆地出现在西方，\r\n将\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]引向我们的世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c02/ms002c02-03.txt/0": "这道灾厄之光会把前方所有生物\r\n化为白灰……\r\n如今仍不断向东方蔓延。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c02/ms002c02-04.txt/0": "那道光正逼近我们的城堡。\r\n我们的世界很快就会化为废墟。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c02/ms002c02-05.txt/0": "勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，我们不能再拖延了。\r\n我们希望立刻向东出发，\r\n讨伐\\c[52]灾厄的使者\\c[0]，堕天使\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c02/ms002c02-06.txt/0": "哦，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，一切都托付给你了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-01.txt/0": "嘿！不知怎的，\r\n我最后成了你的监护人，不过……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-02.txt/0": "早知道会这样，\r\n我就该在森林里找个丈夫，\r\n结婚后安稳过日子！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-03.txt/0": "哈哈！玩笑归玩笑，\r\n你不有几个朋友住在城堡南北两侧吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-04.txt/0": "如果现在出发，\r\n说不定还能救下其中一个。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-05.txt/0": "而且，他们甚至可能加入我们，\r\n在任务中助一臂之力！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-06.txt/0": "但是……\r\n\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]正在逼近，\r\n我们没时间赶到\\c[53]两处\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-07.txt/0": "最多只能到达其中一处。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-08.txt/0": "北方还是南方……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-09.txt/0": "由你来决定！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms002c03/ms002c03-10.txt/0": "明白了！玩笑归玩笑，\r\n这会是艰难的旅程，\r\n但我们全力以赴吧！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c01/ms003c01-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n堕天使\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]就在附近！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c01/ms003c01-02.txt/0": "准备好战斗了吗？\r\n从这里开始必须步步小心！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p01/ms003c02p01-01.txt/0": "原来如此……\r\n你就是\\c[51]康拉斯国王\\c[0]的孩子，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p01/ms003c02p01-02.txt/0": "我不明白你为什么没穿衣服，不过……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p01/ms003c02p01-03.txt/0": "恭喜你走到这里。\r\n但你真的以为自己能终结这场灾厄？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p01/ms003c02p01-04.txt/0": "若想阻止\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]，\r\n就必须打倒我。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p01/ms003c02p01-05.txt/0": "我，堕天使\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]，\r\n就赐予你检验自身实力的荣耀吧！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p02/ms003c02p02-01.txt/0": "唔，你不差……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p02/ms003c02p02-02.txt/0": "我本想留下继续战斗，\r\n但毁灭此世的使命优先……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p02/ms003c02p02-03.txt/0": "呃……\r\n我小看了这个裸体变态。\r\n你还真有本事。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p02/ms003c02p02-04.txt/0": "我本想留下解决你，\r\n但毁灭此世的使命优先……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c02p02/ms003c02p02-05.txt/0": "这次就饶你一命。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p01/ms003c03p01-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，我们又见面了……\r\n你毫不畏缩，还想再次挑战我？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p01/ms003c03p01-02.txt/0": "那么……\r\n这次我会把你当成真正的对手！\r\n今天就让你的挣扎到此为止！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p02/ms003c03p02-01.txt/0": "呃……\r\n区区人类，怎么可能与我战到这种程度……？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p02/ms003c03p02-02.txt/0": "呃……\r\n一个人类，而且是这种变态，\r\n怎会与我战到这种程度……？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p02/ms003c03p02-03.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，这场战斗先推迟。\r\n但下次，我会彻底消灭你！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p03/ms003c03p03-01.txt/0": "那是什么？\r\n你以为这种把戏对我有用？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p03/ms003c03p03-02.txt/0": "真令人作呕……\r\n作为回礼，我就把你烧成灰烬……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p03/ms003c03p03-03.txt/0": "糟了，她生气了……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p04/ms003c03p04-01.txt/0": "呃……\r\n你以为那种手段对曾经是天使的我有效？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p04/ms003c03p04-02.txt/0": "真恶心！\r\n我决定了……勇者，还有你这妖精！\r\n我要让你们在这个世界连痕迹都不剩！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c03p04/ms003c03p04-03.txt/0": "哇啊啊啊！！\r\n她真的非常生气！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-01.txt/0": "呃……这、这种感觉……\r\n啊……这是什么？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-02.txt/0": "这是……\r\n就像我的灵魂被彻底洗净。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-03.txt/0": "这一定是因为……\r\n都是因为你，对吧？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-04.txt/0": "我是\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]。\r\n一名犯下罪孽，被从天界\r\n贬入下界的天使。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-05.txt/0": "我一直怀着的怨恨……\r\n让我与\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]联手，\r\n想要毁灭\\c[52]Creatoire\\c[0]创造的这个世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-06.txt/0": "但现在……我感觉自己\r\n只是被困在一场漫长的噩梦中。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-07.txt/0": "无论我曾怀着怎样的怨恨……\r\n如今都无法再去灭绝这个世界的无辜之人。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-08.txt/0": "啊啊……我该怎样弥补\r\n自己所犯下的罪业？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-09.txt/0": "先从告诉我们怎样解决\r\n那场可怕的\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]开始吧！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-10.txt/0": "不然这个世界\r\n仍然会被彻底毁灭！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-11.txt/0": "这、这倒是……\r\n除了消灭\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]，\r\n没有其他办法拯救这个世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-12.txt/0": "\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]的真身……\r\n是名为\\c[51]Zeukrees\\c[0]的巨人，\r\n一头由\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]历经万古炼成的怪物。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-13.txt/0": "若要攻击\\c[51]Zeukrees\\c[0]，\r\n那深藏于\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]之中……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-14.txt/0": "必须击穿拦在前方的那道\r\n光之壁障。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-15.txt/0": "这片土地上也许存在一种武器，\r\n能够越过那道强大的屏障……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-16.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n请让我加入这场旅程。\r\n我相信，只要我们并肩，就能消灭\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c04/ms003c04-17.txt/0": "让我们消灭我的……不……\r\n\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]的仆从\\c[51]Zeukrees\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c05/ms003c05-01.txt/0": "谢谢你！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c05/ms003c05-02.txt/0": "你竟愿意接纳曾想毁灭世界的我……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c05/ms003c05-03.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，\r\n你真是宽宏大量！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c05/ms003c05-04.txt/0": "堕天使\\c[51]阿尔玛\\c[0]加入了队伍！",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c06/ms003c06-01.txt/0": "曾想毁灭世界的我……是的……\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，我知道你做出了正确决定。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c06/ms003c06-02.txt/0": "我就在这里告辞……\r\n现在，我必须鼓起决心，\r\n独自去挑战\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p01/ms003c07p01-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，谢谢你\r\n让我加入队伍。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p01/ms003c07p01-02.txt/0": "我会把自己知道的一切都告诉你。\r\n有什么问题尽管问。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p02/ms003c07p02-01.txt/0": "\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]……\r\n他想要毁灭这个世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p02/ms003c07p02-02.txt/0": "他的力量与\\c[52]Creatoire\\c[0]相当，\r\n\\c[51]Zeukrees\\c[0]也是由他创造的。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p02/ms003c07p02-03.txt/0": "和我一样，他似乎也因为重罪\r\n被逐出了天界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p02/ms003c07p02-04.txt/0": "什……什么……罪？",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p02/ms003c07p02-05.txt/0": "抱歉……\r\n我记不清了，但我相信……\r\n他违反了“天界律令”。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p03/ms003c07p03-01.txt/0": "\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]的真身……\r\n是由\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]炼成的怪物，\r\n巨人\\c[51]Zeukrees\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p03/ms003c07p03-02.txt/0": "所有被那道光触及的生命\r\n都已化为白灰。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p03/ms003c07p03-03.txt/0": "直到现在，我的心都与\r\n\\c[51]Zeukrees\\c[0]相连，\r\n因此我能够控制他……",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p03/ms003c07p03-04.txt/0": "但当我灵魂中的邪恶被清除后，\r\n他显然也已摆脱我的控制。",
  "message/data/event/mes/main/ms003c07p03/ms003c07p03-05.txt/0": "现在……\r\n要阻止这一切，\r\n唯一的办法就是打倒他。"
}
